der-man homecoming and then and far  from home and it's going to be even more  interesting in spider-man 3.  of course he was peter parker's bully in  homecoming and kind of in far from home  as well  but in far from home we saw him get an  admiration for  spider-man and now he knows that peter  parker is spider-man peter parker the  kid that he used to pick on  is his idol so we know that peter parker  is going to be on the run  in spider-man 3 and perhaps flash is  even going to be willing to help him  in the movie as well perhaps flash will  even come to respect peter parker for  being spider-man and actually want to  help him and  end up helping him now something pretty  interesting to note about flash thompson  that some people may not know is that in  the comics he actually goes on to become  agent venom in the comics flash and  peter actually have a pretty good  developing story arc  they start off just as we see them in  spider-man homecoming and far from home  flash picks on peter  ruthlessly but over time he actually  finds out that he is spider-man and he  begins to respect him and the two of  them  actually become very close flash would  then go on to join the army after  college  and unfortunately he would end up losing  both of his legs in war  but he would kind of get his legs back  by bonding with the venom  symbiote then he would go on to become  agent venom  one of the only characters to go on and  use the venom symbiote to do  good and actually use the symbiote to  fight evil  agent venom works for the us military  and is one of the coolest versions of  venom that we see in the comics but as  far as flash thompson goes in the mcu  it's kind of different  in the comics flash is a big jock who's  a star in the high school football team  and we don't exactly see that with flash  thompson in the mcu  but that doesn't mean that marvel  wouldn't take the opportunity to  at least briefly bond him with the venom  symbiote at some point in time and  seeing as how flash is basically in love  with spider-man and could take the  opportunity of  becoming like him by bonding with the  symbiote it is something that we could  briefly see in the mcu  now it's not something that they would  take from tom hardy but we know that  there are other symbiotes out there  and now that the venom verse with sony  is kind of bonding with the mcu  anything is pretty much possible at this  point in time because flash thompson is  being brought back for a pretty specific  purpose  whether that's just simply to be a  friend to peter parker or whether or not  he's going to end up helping spider-man  and peter in some way shape or form  we'll have to wait and see but in the  meantime this does reveal that at some  point in time he will be in contact with  his friends whether that's in the  beginning  in the middle to ask for some help or at  the end he finally clears his name and  is able to go back to living a normal  life and hang out with his friends  if marvel is playing nice with sony  right now it would be a missed  opportunity to not have agent venom at  least make a tiny cameo at some point in  time  in the mcu and with flash thompson  returning in spider-man 3 it could be  possible but let me know what you think  his role is going to be in spider-man 3.  leave your thoughts down below don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  to stay up to date on all the latest mcu  news for live updates you can follow me  on twitter and  instagram and as always thank you all so  much for watching woof
 

